# Website template — Project architecture

Brand-agnostic auth/admin starter. Stack: pnpm workspace (+ Turbo). Package scope: `@default/*`.

Product & fork docs: [`md/README.md`](../../md/README.md) (`md/fork.md`, `md/architecture.md`).

## Layout

| Path | Package | Role |
|------|---------|------|
| `backend/` | `backend` | NestJS + Drizzle + PostgreSQL — Clean Architecture |
| `backend/src/modules/` | `backend` | **Simple tier** Nest modules (e.g. announcements) |
| `frontend/` | `frontend` | Next.js — FSD + BFF (httpOnly cookies) |
| `packages/types` | `@default/types` | Zod schemas/enums per domain |
| `packages/utils` | `@default/utils` | Domain-agnostic pure helpers |
| `packages/api` | `@default/api` | HTTP client + domain APIs, query-keys |
| `packages/hooks` | `@default/hooks` | React Query hooks |
| `packages/design-tokens` | `@default/design-tokens` | tokens.json → CSS + theme |
| `packages/ui` | `@default/ui` | UI primitives/composed — **no data fetch** |
| `packages/config/tsconfig` | `@default/tsconfig` | Shared TS configs |
| `packages/config/eslint-config` | `@default/eslint-config` | Shared ESLint (+ clean-code) |

**i18n** stays app-local in `frontend/src/shared/i18n` (single Next app). Do not add `@default/i18n` unless backend needs the same catalogs.

## Client data flow (required)

```text
@default/types → @default/api → @default/hooks → features|widgets UI
```

- Server/client Nest data → only `@default/hooks` + `@default/api`
- Features/widgets must **not** call raw `fetch` / `axios` for Nest APIs
- UI-local state hooks may live in the feature; data hooks live in `@default/hooks`
- Feature UI uses design tokens / `@default/ui` — no hardcoded hex

BFF (`frontend/app/api/backend/*`, `app/api/auth/*`) stays in the Next app. `@default/api` uses `/api/backend` (browser) or internal URL (server).

## Backend layers (Clean Architecture)

```text
presentation → application → domain ← infrastructure
```

- Full rules: `.cursor/rules/clean-architecture.mdc`
- Domain: no Nest/ORM deps; repository **interfaces** only
- Application: use cases orchestrate ports; multi-write → one tx in the use-case
- Infrastructure: Drizzle implementations, Redis, JWT, S3
- Presentation: controllers, guards, filters
- REST: `/api/v1/<resource>`

## Frontend (FSD)

- `app/` routes are thin — compose features/widgets
- Layers: `app` → `widgets` → `features` → `entities` → `shared`; `processes` for providers/proxy
- Features must not import widgets
- No deep cross-feature imports; use `shared/` or `@default/*`

## Naming

- Backend domains follow Clean Arch folders under `backend/src/`
- Shared types: `packages/types/src/<name>/`, import `@default/types/<name>`
- FE slices: `frontend/src/features|<entities>/<name>/`

## Do / Don’t

```text
✅ UseCase → port interface → infrastructure repository
✅ feature → useUsers() from @default/hooks
✅ import { UserSchema, type User } from '@default/types/user'
❌ Domain → Nest / Drizzle imports
❌ feature → fetch() / axios / new api.ts for Nest
❌ Second z.object for the same API entity outside @default/types
❌ app/page.tsx with large business UI
```
